Package: firecraft
Version: 0.2.5
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), libgcc-s1, libgl1, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Maintainer: FireCraft contributors <firecraft@localhost>
Homepage: https://github.com/aliasfoxkde/FireCraft
Description: Clean-room reimplementation of Adobe Fireworks CS6
 Editor shell and CLI for the Fireworks PNG (.fw.png) format:
 vector editing, bitmap layers with live filters, text on path,
 symbols and nine-slice, .jsf scripting, and import/export across
 PSD, SVG, PNG, JPEG, GIF and more. WASM-first project; this is
 the native Linux desktop package.
